# Rain on the visor and a fingertip wiping it: out in heavy rain, drops spatter the closed visor and run down it; the right
# index fingertip drawn across the front of the helmet wipes them, with the visor's log naming the hand.
# Needs: Earth Planet, out in the open (under a roof the game's weather does not reach the glass); Options > VR > Display >
# Helmet view, Weather on the visor and Wipe the visor on (the defaults). The test closes the helmet and calls the game's
# heavy rain with its admin chat command (/weather RainHeavy), then clears it.
# The hand is placed from the head with the index finger pointing back at the face: the forearm reaching forward, the
# controller turned nose down (pitch -90). The drawn index fingertip is 12.6 cm along the controller's -Y from its grip
# and 6.7 cm along its -Z (the glove's bind pose on the grip, no grip fit), so the grip 18.6 cm ahead and 6.7 cm above the
# eyes puts the tip 6 cm ahead of them at eye height and 3 cm right of the grip: 4 cm into the helmet's front, which
# stands 9 cm ahead of the eyes, where the drawn hand stops on it (HelmetStop) and the fingertip's touch is kept. The
# controller's -Z pointed at the face instead would put the tip 15 cm below the eyes, under the chin.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
goto open 20
helmet on
read character
expect helmet == true within 5

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2
# out in the open the grass sways in the wind: a second apart the view differs by about 5 however still the head is
expect headset steady 8
headset rain-before.png

key Enter
wait 0.5
type /weather RainHeavy
key Enter
expect log Visor weather: rain on the visor within 60
wait 10
headset rain-on.png
expect headset changed 12

# the right index fingertip across the front of the visor, left to right at eye height: the tip from 3 cm left of the
# middle to 3 cm right of it
hand right -0.06 1.667 -0.186 0 -90 0
wait 0.7
hand right -0.045 1.667 -0.186 0 -90 0
wait 0.2
hand right -0.03 1.667 -0.186 0 -90 0
wait 0.2
hand right -0.015 1.667 -0.186 0 -90 0
wait 0.2
hand right 0 1.667 -0.186 0 -90 0
wait 0.5
expect log Hand stop: Right hand on the helmet within 5
expect log Visor weather: the right fingertip wipes the visor within 5

key Enter
wait 0.5
type /weather clear
key Enter
expect log Visor weather: no weather falls on the visor now within 60
expect no log Visor weather failed
expect no log Exception

cleanup
reset
